category: Libs
requires: cygwin libfolia22 libgcc1 libicu76 libstdc++6 libticcutils10 libucto6
sdesc: "Advanced rule-based unicode-aware tokenizer (utilities)"
ldesc: "Ucto tokenizes text files: it separates words from punctuation, and splits
sentences. It offers several other basic preprocessing steps such as changing
case that you can all use to make your text suited for further processing such
as indexing, part-of-speech tagging, or machine translation."

